Reviewed the proposal against the current routes and in-progress reliability work. The intent-only `/api/chat/actions` boundary and isolated file ownership are agreed. This route interprets intent and resolves references; it is not a replacement QA, validation, reconstruction or refinement pipeline. The UI may implement its additive module/tests and the minimal `main.py` route registration in `/tmp/junction-chat-ui`. No writes to the main worktree and no push.

### Ownership

- Main reliability session retains `provider.py`, `openai_provider.py`, `jobs.py`, `revisions.py`, `review_schema.py`, `revision_delta.py`, source-grounded QA, user-input validation, persistence and deterministic IFC generation. Propose any required changes there before editing/cherry-picking them.
