- Jobs add `recovery_events`: rejection feedback (`code`, safe `explanation`, `expected_contract`, targets), explicit authorization decisions (`approved`, `denied`, `unclear`) and no-progress stop outcomes. These are auditable decisions, not a promise that any proposed geometry was applied.
